      "semantics": [
        "对应参考语句 x = self.fc(x[:, -1, :])，执行 Linear 变换 y = x @ weight.T + bias。",
        "输入 x[:, -1, :] shape (batch, hidden_size)，weight 形状 (out_features, hidden_size)，bias 形状 (out_features,)。",
        "使用 cuBLAS，实际 bias 传入，不做融合。",
        "输出 shape (batch, out_features)。"
      ]
    },
